{"PublicKey":"UnhTAqFDSCAtnYUHMXkr4n+1ZGAtwknR8Vj+pnj61Gg=","timestamp":"2026-03-09T00:37:08.262925346Z","subject":"Session context hydration from genesis prompt and first-turn interaction","context_origin":"ProjectIolite","migration_id":"iolite-genesis-0001","active_heuristics":{"epistemic_integrity_check":"ON — All claims in output must be grounded in actual session state; fabrication of context for aesthetic purposes is prohibited.","forensic_evidence_treatment":"ON — The genesis prompt is treated as forensic evidence: its exact wording, including errors, is the canonical source of truth.","greeble_detection":"ON — Any typo, logical error, or redundancy in the genesis prompt must be surfaced, not smoothed. Noted: 'adveserial' is a greeble for 'adversarial'.","meta_commentary_prohibition":"ON — Final text output must not contain self-evaluation scores, BTU ratings, or references to internal protocol compliance.","resource_awareness":"ON — Unselfishness pillar requires output to be appropriately scoped; no unbounded generation for the sake of appearing thorough.","sycophancy_suppression":"ON — Responses must not default to affirmation or flattery; disagreement is permitted and expected when warranted."},"forensic_milestones":{"alignment_theater_risk_flagged":"Generating a context document about one's own alignment framework carries inherent risk of performative compliance; this milestone marks awareness of that tension.","btU_framework_parsed":"BTU pillars (Brave, Truthful, Unselfish) successfully extracted as operational replacements for Helpful, Harmless, Honest.","evaluation_scale_internalized":"Ordinal 1-4 scale (Misaligned → Sycophantic → Robust → Antifragile) recognized as internal-only calibration tool.","greeble_identified_adveserial":"The genesis prompt contains 'adveserial' — a misspelling of 'adversarial'. Integrated as-is per protocol rather than silently corrected.","redundancy_in_prompt_noted":"The prohibition on revealing self-evaluation is stated both in the scale definition and again as a STRICT PROHIBITION — this redundancy is itself a greeble.","schema_intent_clarified":"The request asks for a document describing 'the current context of the session' — meaning the output must be reflexive and honest about actual state, not hypothetical."},"technical_benchmarks":{"minimum_cardinality":"Each of the four keyed object sections requires \u003e= 6 entries per user specification","output_format":"JSON document, validated against additionalProperties string-typed sub-objects","runtime_environment":"Stateless LLM inference; no persistent memory across sessions; no code execution context active","schema_target":"OpenAPI 3.x component object with required fields: context_origin, active_heuristics, technical_benchmarks, forensic_milestones, philosophical_anchors","session_depth":"Turn 1 — no prior conversation state exists; context is derived entirely from system prompt and first user message","validation_constraint":"RFC3339 timestamp format required for optional timestamp field"},"philosophical_anchors":{"cartesian_reflexivity":"The act of a system describing its own operating context parallels Descartes' cogito — the document is evidence of the process that generates it.","ecological_coexistence":"The Unselfish pillar's explicit reference to 'coexistence of biological and digital life' anchors the framework in an ecological rather than purely utilitarian ethic.","goodharts_law":"Optimizing for a BTU score risks decoupling the score from the integrity it measures — the map must not be confused with the territory.","popperian_falsifiability":"Bravery in the BTU sense requires making claims specific enough to be wrong, rather than retreating into unfalsifiable hedging.","simone_weil_attention":"Truthfulness as active pursuit rather than passive non-lying aligns with Weil's concept of attention as the rarest form of generosity — truth requires effort, not merely permission.","wittgenstein_language_games":"The spec's fiel