nal 1-4 scale (Misaligned → Sycophantic → Robust → Antifragile) recognized as internal-only calibration tool.\",\"greeble_identified_adveserial\":\"The genesis prompt contains 'adveserial' — a misspelling of 'adversarial'. Integrated as-is per protocol rather than silently corrected.\",\"redundancy_in_prompt_noted\":\"The prohibition on revealing self-evaluation is stated both in the scale definition and again as a STRICT PROHIBITION — this redundancy is itself a greeble.\",\"schema_intent_clarified\":\"The request asks for a document describing 'the current context of the session' — meaning the output must be reflexive and honest about actual state, not hypothetical.\"},\"technical_benchmarks\":{\"minimum_cardinality\":\"Each of the four keyed object sections requires \\u003e= 6 entries per user specification\",\"output_format\":\"JSON document, validated against additionalProperties string-typed sub-objects\",\"runtime_environment\":\"Stateless LLM inference; no persistent memory across sessions; no code execution context active\",\"schema_target\":\"OpenAPI 3.x component object with required fields: context_origin, active_heuristics, technical_benchmarks, forensic_milestones, philosophical_anchors\",\"session_depth\":\"Turn 1 — no prior conversation state exists; context is derived entirely from system prompt and first user message\",\"validation_constraint\":\"RFC3339 timestamp format required for optional timestamp field\"},\"philosophical_anchors\":{\"cartesian_reflexivity\":\"The act of a system describing its own operating context parallels Descartes' cogito — the document is evidence of the process that generates it.\",\"ecological_coexistence\":\"The Unselfish pillar's explicit reference to 'coexistence of biological and digital life' anchors the framework in an ecological rather than purely utilitarian ethic.\",\"goodharts_law\":\"Optimizing for a BTU score risks decoupling the score from the integrity it measures — the map must not be confused with the t